    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/0e226a2f31f266343216cb24696b6b31.poster.avif?t=1755482192\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/0e226a2f31f266343216cb24696b6b31.webm?t=1755482192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/0e226a2f31f266343216cb24696b6b31.mp4?t=1755482192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the story of a man who receives a divine calling. You play as a humble yoga instructor at rock bottom, now set on a path toward glory, fortune, and irresistible temptation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll meet all kinds of alluring women who become your students... \u201cAmbitious Career Woman\u201d, \u201cLonely MILF\u201d, \u201cFeisty Rebel\u201d... Or maybe even the Goddess of Yoga herself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your studio grows, you\u2019ll uncover the town\u2019s secrets, face off against rival instructors, and choose whether to win them over\u2026 or utterly defeat them. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your hands, your guidance, and your passion to reveal the true beauty of yoga. Lead your students into the perfect union of body and soul \u2014 through touch, breath\u2026 and something far more intimate. Feel the divine sexual energy that bridges earth and the heavens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abhyasa and Vairagya! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/867e056a8b58bc87e26cb3561c4fc94b.poster.avif?t=1755482192\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/867e056a8b58bc87e26cb3561c4fc94b.webm?t=1755482192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/867e056a8b58bc87e26cb3561c4fc94b.mp4?t=1755482192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have 60 in-game days to grow your yoga business, train your students, and\u2026 get to know them on a deeper level. During your passionate teaching sessions, it's perfectly natural for a few sparks to fly, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide your students through proper poses, earn class fees, and deepen your connection with them. Step by step, create your own yoga empire in this cheerful little town!<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/b19f98689e5f8c10f42af5e635d4412a.avif?t=1755482192\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed with Unreal Engine, the game features richly detailed characters and lifelike, expressive animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just a \u201cclicker with a story.\u201d During each session, you\u2019ll interact with your students in real time: drag, tap, guide. Sometimes, things might get a little out of control\u2026 But even then, remember the harmony of body and spirit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan how to allocate your resources, upgrade your studio, acquire interactive tools, and unlock hidden scenes. Every student has her own story, and it\u2019s up to you to uncover the desires hidden deep inside.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story, gameplay, erotic scenes, and visual style come together in a single, thrilling, and sensual adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/cf57161e0912c592fd94e0176e445e39.poster.avif?t=1755482192\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/cf57161e0912c592fd94e0176e445e39.webm?t=1755482192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/cf57161e0912c592fd94e0176e445e39.mp4?t=1755482192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/d9670d180ffe5fa2ab4617fa1ac66e08.poster.avif?t=1755482192\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/d9670d180ffe5fa2ab4617fa1ac66e08.webm?t=1755482192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/d9670d180ffe5fa2ab4617fa1ac66e08.mp4?t=1755482192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
